          "body": "The white mask cannot be confined to intentional pretending: a subject becomes accomplished in the forms through which the dominant world recognises him, while the standard of recognition becomes a rule for administering his own life. Not four detachable masks: speech, self-image and recognition are ways the same hierarchy becomes consequential. A legible form opens participation, and participation reinforces the measure admission depended on.",
